# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reference clone of the Pi agent harness.
#
# This is upstream code, not part of Kubic. It is checked out read-only as an
# implementation reference for the Kubic design (see docs/design/). It is not
# built, linted, tested or modified by this repository, and it will be removed
# once Kubic no longer needs it as a reference.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/pi/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kubic design documents.
#
# The design work is kept local: the document, the decision registry, the
# generated explorer, the vendored generator and the explorer's annotation
# files all live under docs/design/ and are not published to the remote. They
# remain on disk and stay the source of truth for the design; they are simply
# not tracked.
#
# Ignoring a path does not remove it from history. These files were tracked
# before this rule existed, so their earlier revisions remain in origin's
# history until it is rewritten.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/design/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Node
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.yarn/
.npm/
.pnpm-store/

